{"id": "mexican-museum-grant-and-duplicate-expenses", "title": "The Mexican Museum grant paid duplicate expenses before the grant expired", "seconds": 40.5, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "9000f361769972f8", "words": 111, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The Controller identified costs the Mexican Museum claimed more than once.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.78, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Duplicate", "expenses"], "sub": "Mexican Museum grant"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.55, 1.07, 1.51, 1.63, 2.04, 2.48, 2.82, 2.98, 3.16]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "The audit classified 43,616 dollars as ineligible.", "t0": 3.9, "t1": 8.19, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "sf-controller", "text": "March 2024 audit", "mark": "March 2024 audit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.46, 1.04, 1.5, 2.06, 2.35, 2.7, 3.11, 3.5, 3.64]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "That total included 21,250 dollars in duplicate expenses already paid.", "t0": 8.31, "t1": 13.54, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Ineligible costs", "heading": "Duplicate expenses are included", "source": "audit", "rows": [{"icon": "audit", "label": "All ineligible costs", "value": "$43,616"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Of that total, duplicate expenses", "value": "$21,250"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.76, 1.18, 1.7, 2.26, 2.48, 2.75, 3.04, 3.45, 3.57, 4.02, 4.57, 4.88]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "Another 930,247 dollars were classified as questionable.", "t0": 13.66, "t1": 18.66, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$930,247", "label": "Separately classified as questionable"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.66, 0.94, 1.25, 1.71, 1.96, 2.26, 2.84, 3.59, 3.77, 4.25, 4.35]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "Some salaries and accounting services lacked sufficient support.", "t0": 18.78, "t1": 21.57, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Insufficient support"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.74, 0.84, 1.25, 1.72, 1.97, 2.4]}, {"scene": "terms", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The amended agreement required the successor agency to confirm which costs were ineligible.", "t0": 21.79, "t1": 25.88, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "terms", "kicker": "San Francisco Office of Community Investment and Infrastructure", "text": "Amended grant terms", "mark": "Amended grant terms"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.44, 0.9, 1.25, 1.35, 1.85, 2.29, 2.41, 2.77, 2.97, 3.28, 3.44]}, {"scene": "terms", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[1]", "defense[0]"], "text": "The agency had approved the submitted expenses.", "t0": 26.0, "t1": 28.25, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Agency approval"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.55, 0.67, 1.04, 1.15, 1.55]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In January 2026, the agency listed the grant as expired.", "t0": 28.47, "t1": 32.02, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "schedule", "kicker": "San Francisco Office of Community Investment and Infrastructure", "text": "Item 151", "mark": "Item 151"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.6, 0.89, 1.65, 1.81, 2.22, 2.52, 2.61, 2.87, 3.0]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "Its schedule still listed final reconciliation as pending.", "t0": 32.14, "t1": 35.1, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Final reconciliation pending"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.65, 0.92, 1.3, 1.61, 2.4, 2.53]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "next[0]"], "text": "The final repayment balance remains unknown.", "t0": 35.22, "t1": 37.37, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Final repayment balance", "Agency determinations"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.46, 0.96, 1.33, 1.68]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 37.49, "t1": 39.63, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "Reimbursements", "terms": "Reimbursement conditions", "close": "Final reconciliation"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "document"}